https://github.com/databendlabs/databend/issues/20484  confirmed

DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS repro_databend925_db2_min;
CREATE DATABASE repro_databend925_db2_min;
USE repro_databend925_db2_min;

CREATE TABLE source(
  vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL,
  c2int BIGINT NULL
) ENGINE=FUSE;

INSERT INTO source VALUES (1, -1), (2, 1);

CREATE TABLE part_l(
  vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL
) ENGINE=FUSE;

CREATE TABLE part_r(
  vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL,
  c2int BIGINT NULL
) ENGINE=FUSE;

INSERT INTO part_l SELECT vp_rowid FROM source;
INSERT INTO part_r SELECT vp_rowid, c2int FROM source;

SELECT c2int % 1.0 AS e1, -c2int AS e2
FROM source
ORDER BY c2int % 1.0, -c2int;

SELECT r.c2int % 1.0 AS e1, -r.c2int AS e2
FROM part_l l
JOIN part_r r ON l.vp_rowid = r.vp_rowid
ORDER BY r.c2int % 1.0, -r.c2int;

两者真实执行结果都是：

ERROR 1105 (HY000): UnwindError. Code: 1104, Text = assertion failed: partition.total > 0.

SELECT c2int % 1 AS e1, -c2int AS e2
FROM source
ORDER BY c2int % 1, -c2int;

正常返回，所以 1.0 触发的浮点零符号路径很关键。单行 (-1) 不触发，同号两行 (-1),(-2) 也不触发；一负一正产生 -0.0 和 0.0 才触发。

更小可复现形态是 ORDER BY 对两个键排序，其中第一个键为 BIGINT % FLOAT_LITERAL 并产生 -0.0/0.0，第二个键打破并列排序。